Package: mcpserver
Title: Model Context Protocol Server SDK
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Phi", "Bya", email = "hungbya@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers in R that expose
    tools, resources, and prompts to large language model clients. Supports
    the stdio and Streamable HTTP transports defined by the MCP
    specification (protocol revision 2025-06-18), with non-blocking handler
    execution via 'mirai' worker daemons and Server-Sent Events streaming
    via 'nanonext'. Includes optional OAuth 2.1 resource server validation
    and the building blocks (sampling, elicitation, roots, completions,
    progress, logging, subscriptions, tasks) needed to reach feature parity
    with reference MCP servers.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tinnlab/mcpserver-r
BugReports: https://github.com/tinnlab/mcpserver-r/issues
